---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Eight34 Labs" description="Meet Tee Jay, founder of Eight34. How Eight34 grew from a web engineering studio into an AI consultancy for local businesses in Ridgewood, Bergen County, and New Jersey.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="hero-pill">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        <span>About</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Eight34 Labs, <em>rebuilt around one goal.</em></h1>
      <p>Eight34 began as a web engineering studio — building websites and digital products. The craft is the same; the mission is now focused: bring practical AI to the local businesses that big tech overlooks.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Meet Tee Jay -->
    <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Founder</span>
        <h2>Meet Tee Jay</h2>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-500); max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Tee Jay is the founder of Eight34, based in the New York City metropolitan area. His background is in building modern websites and digital products — the engineering discipline behind Eight34 Labs&rsquo; first chapter.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-500); max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
        Eight34 Labs is his consultancy for the next one: helping local businesses in Ridgewood and across New Jersey find where AI genuinely saves money, and setting it up properly — no hype, no jargon, no overselling.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content: flex-start;">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/teejay834/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 14px;">Tee Jay on LinkedIn ↗</a>
        <a class="btn-outline" href="/contact" style="padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 14px;">Work with Eight34 →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Goal -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-150);">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">The goal</span>
        <h2>Make AI pay for itself — for the businesses on our own main streets first.</h2>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-500); max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        Start in Ridgewood. Prove it business by business across Bergen County. Then take the same honest, in-person approach across New Jersey. Every setup has to earn its keep in hours or dollars — that&rsquo;s the whole strategy.
      </p>
      <div class="goal-strip">
        <div class="goal-item">Ridgewood, NJ</div>
        <div class="goal-item">Bergen County</div>
        <div class="goal-item">New Jersey</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- From studio to consultancy -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-150);">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>From studio to consultancy</h2>
        <p>What carried over — and what changed</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">KEPT: THE CRAFT</span>
          <h3>Kept: the craft</h3>
          <p>The engineering standards from our studio days — clean builds, tested work, privacy-respecting tools, and handover documentation — now applied to AI setup instead of websites.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">CHANGED: THE CLIENT</span>
          <h3>Changed: the client</h3>
          <p>Not startups and screens, but shops, restaurants, practices, and trades — businesses where a saved hour is a real, countable thing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">NEW: THE MEASURE</span>
          <h3>New: the measure</h3>
          <p>Success isn&rsquo;t a launch announcement. It&rsquo;s a shorter week, a smaller bill, a question answered at 9pm without anyone on call.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Principles -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-150);">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Principles</h2>
        <p>How Eight34 Labs decides things</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principles-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <h3>Savings first, technology second</h3>
          <p>Every recommendation has to name the hours or dollars it gives back. A tool that can&rsquo;t do that — however impressive the demo — doesn&rsquo;t get recommended.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <h3>Honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;</h3>
          <p>Some tasks should stay human, and some businesses are already lean. Saying so, even when it costs us a project, is how a local consultancy earns the next ten years of referrals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <h3>Your business stays yours</h3>
          <p>Your accounts, your data, your logins, documented in a guide your team can follow. If you ever stop working with us, everything keeps running without us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <h3>Small steps, proven before scaled</h3>
          <p>One workflow working and paying off before the next begins. It&rsquo;s slower to sell and much better to own — which is the side of the table we sit on with you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How we measure it -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-150);">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>How we measure it</h2>
        <p>If it isn&rsquo;t saving, it isn&rsquo;t working</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">HOURS</span>
          <h3>Hours given back</h3>
          <p>Counted against the routine work the setup took over — the same numbers the Services worksheet starts from.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">ANSWERS</span>
          <h3>Questions answered well</h3>
          <p>Customer questions resolved accurately, with anything unusual escalated to a person, never guessed at.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">ADOPTION</span>
          <h3>The team actually using it</h3>
          <p>A setup the staff avoids saves nothing. Adoption is a success metric, not an afterthought.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="num">REFERRALS</span>
          <h3>You&rsquo;d recommend it locally</h3>
          <p>The Ridgewood → Bergen County → New Jersey plan only works if each business would say so to the one next door.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 28px; display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a class="btn-outline" href="/services" style="padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 14px;">See the services →</a>
        <a class="btn-outline" href="/process" style="padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 14px;">See the process</a>
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact" style="padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 14px;">Contact us</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-150); padding-bottom: 90px;">
      <div class="contact-cta-box">
        <h2>Start with a conversation.</h2>
        <p>Tell us where your week goes — we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly if AI can help.</p>
        <div class="contact-cta-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact" style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 14.5px;">Contact Us →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
